    Project "1" --> "*" Object : HAS_OBJECT
    Project "1" --> "*" System : HAS_SYSTEM
    Object --> Requirement : IS_FOR
    System --> Requirement : IS_FOR

    Order --> Deliverable : IS_ORDER_FOR_DELIVERABLE
    Order --> Invoice : IS_ORDER_FOR_INVOICE
    Deliverable --> Work : IS_DELIVERABLE_FOR_WORK
    Work --> Worklog : IS_WORK_FOR_WORKLOG
    Work --> Material : IS_WORK_FOR_MATERIAL
    Work --> Requirement : IS_WORK_FOR_REQUIREMENT

    Requirement --> TestCase : IS_REQUIREMENT_FOR_TEST_CASE
    Requirement --> File : IS_REQUIREMENT_FOR_FILE
    TestProject --> TestBuild : IS_TEST_PROJECT_FOR_BUILD
    TestBuild --> TestPlan : IS_TEST_BUILD_FOR_PLAN
    TestPlan --> TestSuite : IS_TEST_PLAN_FOR_SUITE
    TestSuite --> TestCase : IS_TEST_SUITE_FOR_CASE
    TestCase --> TestCaseExecution : IS_TEST_CASE_FOR_EXECUTION
    TestCaseExecution --> File : input or evidence file
    TestRun --> TestCaseExecution : via test lists

    VerificationItem --> Requirement : assessment subject
    VerificationItem --> File : assessment subject
    VerificationItem --> File : supporting input
    VerificationItem --> TestCaseExecution : executed as
    TestRun --> VerificationItem : includes
    TestCase ..> VerificationItem : as-is stand-in for test kind

    Register --> Node : concerns item

